# Sorting Rock (CIPlay sorting_rock_solo; in the plan after Pneumatic Heights): quest "Weighed and Sorted"
# (it needs Lise's dead letter from The Dead Letter Office: sorting_rock_solo.play reads it first)
island Sorting Rock
offset 0 39
expect step 0
expect title Weighed and Sorted
expect hidden lisereply
zone hall_door
expect step 1
read Rate chart
expect step 2
use scale1
expect message Nothing to weigh
open Sorter's tool rack
wait 3
expect item MetalDetector 1
expect item Shovel 1
expect step 3
dig 0
expect story parcelweights 1
expect step 4
open Rates office
expect message shutter
use scale1
use scale1
use scale2
use scale4
expect story weighed 3
expect step 5
open Rates office
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_WaterTank 1
expect item Blueprint_Pipe_Water 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricPurifier 1
expect item Blueprint_Storage_Large 1
expect item Blueprint_Recycler 1
expect step 11
use liselocker
expect story lisedelivered 1
expect shown lisereply
expect step 12
# POST 10-26: the hub, Greta Moberg, the climb, Slate Cave, the secrets
expect hidden qr_rewchest
use qr_machine
expect hidden qr_rewchest
read Crane driver's notice
expect step 13
use Greta Moberg
wait 1
expect step 14
expect hidden qr_lampchest
use Quarry lamp 1
use Quarry lamp 2
wait 1
expect shown qr_lampchest
open Greta's cash box
zone qr_trail
expect step 15
zone qr_summit
expect step 16
open Quarry mast deck box
wait 3
expect story qr_top 1
expect step 17
zone qr_cave
expect step 18
open Slate Cave chest
wait 3
expect story qr_cave 1
expect step 19
use qr_machine
expect shown qr_rewchest
expect story qr_fixed 1
open Parcel crane reward
wait 3
read Crane cab slip
expect step 20
# the secrets: the plane, the jumps, the maze, the set
zone qr_plane
open Freight plane's crate
read Freight pilot's note
zone qr_jumps
open Quarry stair
open Top of the quarry steps
zone qr_maze
open Unsorted parcel
expect hidden qr_setchest
use qr_piece1
use qr_piece2
use qr_piece3
use qr_piece4
use qr_piece5
wait 2
expect shown qr_setchest
open Label drawer
read Lise's reply
expect done
